          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enyaaka Reu abik ilarin iip are o opishana eidipaki aatoiu Serug, neeta apa kulikae ayiok o ntoyie.",
